{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"sword_steel","model_identifier":"sword_steel","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## sword_steel\n\nOne-handed weapon, steel (own geometry).\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.0..1.0, y -4.5..4.5, z -32.0..5.5 (size 2.0 x 9.0 x 37.5 u = 6 x 25 x 105 cm).\nSteel arming sword, about 1.05 m (37.5 u): longer and finer than the iron sword: slimmer blade, longer fuller, wider cross guard with turned-down tips, cord-wrapped grip. Grip at the origin, point 32 u forward (-Z), edges up/down. One-handed. Steel and high-quality steel textures.\n- Embedded texture: steel. Tier textures: steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `sword_steel_steel.png`, `sword_steel_hq_steel.png`\n"},"description":"## sword_steel\n\nOne-handed weapon, steel (own geometry).\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.0..1.0, y -4.5..4.5, z -32.0..5.5 (size 2.0 x 9.0 x 37.5 u = 6 x 25 x 105 cm).\nSteel arming sword, about 1.05 m (37.5 u): longer and finer than the iron sword: slimmer blade, longer fuller, wider cross guard with turned-down tips, cord-wrapped grip. Grip at the origin, point 32 u forward (-Z), edges up/down. One-handed. Steel and high-quality steel textures.\n- Embedded texture: steel. Tier textures: steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `sword_steel_steel.png`, `sword_steel_hq_steel.png`\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"pommel","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,-1.0,4.0],"to":[1.0,1.0,5.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[12,31,14.0,33.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[14,31,15.5,33.0],"texture":